WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.870
<i>That day, that time...</i>

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:07.960
<i>Shibuya was struck</i>
<i>by a mysterious huge disaster.</i>

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.260
<i>All we could see</i>

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.760
<i>was an unfamiliar wasteland.</i>

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.390
<i>We knew nothing,</i>
<i>and we were attacked by a strange beast.</i>

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>Then I met Milo again.</i>

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.140
<i>The String Puppet.</i>

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.350
<i>With the power I was given,</i>

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.190
<i>I will protect everyone!</i>

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:29.610
<i>Because that is my duty and destiny!</i>

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.910
I can pilot it!<i></i>I can pilot it, Milo!

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.370
-This...
<i>-String Puppet.</i>

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:41.040
<i>Of course. It's tuned for use by you.</i>

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.960
<i>It's your own power.</i>

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.380
It's that thing.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:02.350
It's the monster!

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.650
Ms. Yumiko!

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:19.950
OK, bring it on.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.910
I will protect you, Keisaku and Marimari!

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:28.210
<i>This is when the preparations</i>
<i>I've made will finally pay off!</i>

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:29.920
<i>That's what I thought.</i>

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:11.020
<i>I will now conduct automated display</i>
<i>optimization to fit the Master.</i>

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.310
Master?

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.310
Master, huh?

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.570
<i>Please tell me</i>
<i>if changes need to be made at any time.</i>

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.780
Hey, can't this thing

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.330
move any faster?
I can't defeat the enemy like this!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:29.330
<i>Attempting to improve processing speed.</i>

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.580
<i>-Error. Please put on a neurosuit.</i>
-Milo!

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:36.040
<i>-It's saying something about a suit.</i>
<i>-</i>I did not have time to prepare one.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:39.010
But you should be able to defeat it
with the power of the String Puppet.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.340
<i>But this thing is so stiff!</i>

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:44.590
Either aim for joints,
<i>focus fire on one spot or use your ERK.</i>

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.260
ERK?

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.100
It's a sword!

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.140
Bring it on!

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.820
Don't I have anything else?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.490
<i>These are your equipped weapons</i>
<i>and ammunition count.</i>

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.240
What is this "shot type"?

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:10.080
<i>You can select from normal, guided,</i>
<i>shotgun, and burst.</i>

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:13.540
What? Why didn't you tell me?
Let's go with guided!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.590
So, there's ammo of each type.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.470
What the heck is that?

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.590
-Hey, isn't that Daisuke?
-Really?

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.890
What? What is he doing?

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:31.980
-What is that? Is it really Daisuke?
-How should I know?

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.150
I will protect you!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.610
Booster!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.580
Yes!

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.680
This is the Shibuya Police!

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.350
We received a call saying
there was an explosion in this area.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:13.350
I'll tell you what to do,
so please stay calm and--

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.480
Everyone!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.830
-What the hell is that?
-Is it alive? Look how it moves.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.960
Alive? Are you stupid?

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.960
Will we be safe here?
I mean, look out there.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:46.300
Hey, that was Daisuke, right?

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.340
He was kind of far. I'm not sure.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.140
Where did Lu and Gai go?

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.100
I'm sure they'll be back soon.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:56.560
Is this the future disaster
that Daisuke talked about?

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.350
THE END AND THE BEGINNING

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:02.820
You know,
if it wasn't Daisuke, then who sent

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.280
this message?

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:08.860
Take that!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.000
Crap!

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.750
Was there someone inside?

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.170
<i>Roger. Scanning now.</i>

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.670
<i>No humans detected</i>
<i>in the surrounding buildings.</i>

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.760
This thing sure is tough!

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:37.270
Who said you could shoplift?

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.270
That's right. You haven't paid.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.440
-OK, I'll share it with you.
-That's not what I mean.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:45.780
This is a state of emergency!
We should be helping each other.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:46.990
Act like an adult.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.070
You think you're cool, huh, kid?

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.120
Wasn't that a bit much, Lu?

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.200
You think so?

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.880
What's all the noise been about?

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:09.220
Mayor! Shibata from <i>Asanuki Newspaper.</i>

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.090
Working hard even when
infrastructures are down, I see.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.390
Any word from the--

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:16.810
-He's heading to a meeting now.
-The elderly like me have it the toughest.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.180
The young can

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.520
-take care of themselves.
-We'll hear you out after the meeting.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.150
I'm sorry. You must stop here.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.110
-You, add "headquarters" to that.
-Hey, Mr. Muta!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.320
-What?
-Hey, you!

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.440
-Okay, I'll do that.
-Mr. Muta!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.400
SHIBUYA CITY DISASTER CONTROL

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:36.490
Have you reached the Cabinet Office yet?
What about the Governor?

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:41.160
No. Moreover, all the landlines are down.
The Internet and satellites as well.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.710
-What about mobile phones?
-The strange thing is

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.590
it works in certain areas.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:48.510
We believe it's because
of the Disaster Control Base.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:52.090
A widespread power outage
and the GPS out of service.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.510
This is quite strange.

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.800
Assemble all
Disaster Prevention Committee members,

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:58.260
especially Mr. Kuroiwa
from the Shibuya Police Department.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.310
-Yes, sir.
-Where's Suzumura?

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:03.560
He was to play golf with people
from civil works, but I can't reach him.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:04.520
Golf?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.060
It's rather unavoidable.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.070
Fine then.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.030
Are the railways completely
out of commission?

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:11.740
Yes, JR doesn't know when it can restart.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.860
What about the subways?

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.570
It seems the tracks are broken.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.330
Broken, you say?
Someone, get me some tea.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.620
What about that guy from the armed forces
we met the other day?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.830
You mean Captain Nakanishi
from First Infantry Regiment?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.960
He's a member of the Disaster Prevention
Committee after all.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.130
Let's ask him for help.

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.760
We need Shibuya Defense Force helicopters
and communication system.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.720
You mean, request for Disaster Relief?

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:36.430
I wonder if we can get through.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.010
We've received reports saying
the roads have been blocked.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:42.020
We got those reports too! They say
it's all ruins outside of Shibuya.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.310
That's ridiculous.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.730
That's not a terrorist attack, is it?

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:47.860
Terrorists?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.110
What's that?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.240
Are those guys inside there alive?

00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:59.780
<i>I detect signs of life.</i>

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.750
<i>It's a bio-cage.</i>

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.580
<i>As long as they're inside it,</i>
<i>they are alive.</i>

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.420
<i>-You can ignore it during battle.</i>
-Ignore it?

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.170
-What are you doing, Daisuke?
<i>-I have to save them!</i>

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.800
You're not ready for that.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.010
This is the first time
you're using a String Puppet!

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.430
And without a neurosuit too.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:20.680
<i>-That lowers your power and speed.</i>
-If they're alive, I have to save them!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.930
This is what
I've been working so hard for!

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:27.940
<i>-What are you talking about?</i>
-You told me to protect everyone!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.610
Right now, focus on destroying the enemy.
Switch to burst mode shots.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.360
-From that position, focus on its legs.
<i>-I can't!</i>

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.110
I'll hit the guys inside!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.910
<i>It will get you first. Shoot!</i>

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.200
No! I'm going to save them!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.700
They're more ignorant than we expected.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.080
Okay.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.880
<i>-The connections!</i>
-What?

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:54.300
<i>If you destroy the two connecting points,</i>
<i>you can remove it.</i>

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.470
Milo! Thank you!

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:58.550
There it is!

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:09.690
I did it!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.790
<i>Good job, Daisuke.</i>

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:33.880
I defeated it.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.210
<i>Hey, Daisuke.</i>

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.470
<i>Wow, I am amazing!</i>

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.720
<i>Now, I can protect everyone!</i>

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.970
<i>It was just like what Milo said,</i>
<i>this is my destiny!</i>

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.770
Are you hurt, Daisuke?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.810
-Daisuke!
<i>-I'm fine!</i>

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:02.910
What is that?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.660
In order to protect everyone,

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:09.370
-I used this and went bam...
-Daisuke!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.300
There!

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:20.720
Thank you!

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:24.890
No problem. I'm sure it will be chaos
at the hospital now anyway.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.970
Go home and disinfect it.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.440
-Yes, thank you!
-Thank you!

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.610
Damn.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:36.650
What the heck is going on?

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.320
SHIBUYA POLICE STATION

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:43.110
<i>We've sent radios</i>
<i>to the Disaster Control Headquarters.</i>

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:46.280
The fire department is
at Disaster Control as well.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:47.370
What should we do?

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.330
The Mayor is requesting we join them
at Disaster Control immediately.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.670
I'll leave it
to Deputy Chief Ikenaga for now.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.210
Right now, we need to figure out
how to deal with this.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:58.670
Who provided the images?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:01.010
They were still in shock,
so they're in the infirmary.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:05.140
-A person was piloting this.
-Doesn't it look like a student?

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.970
Have the Riot Squad secure
the destroyed monster.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:12.350
After confirming it's safe,
get it to forensics.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.390
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.110
Does that mean this robot is on our side?

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.320
It's too early to tell.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.150
Is Izumi in the area?

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.990
Yes, but the radios
are not working very well.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.620
A strange monster and a strange robot...

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:30.580
Have I lost my mind?

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.370
Or is this...

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.880
Man, everyone is freaked out.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.460
I know. I don't even know where to start.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:43.380
Yes. I'm wondering about her too.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.260
Come on! I told you!

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.970
The time Milo was talking about
has come!

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:51.060
My destiny has finally arrived!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:55.770
After actually fighting with this thing
with my life on the line, I felt it.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.820
-Daisuke.
-I can show it to you now if you want.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:01.320
This is no time to joke around!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.070
Calm down, Gai.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:06.660
But you said this is the future disaster

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.580
-and the enemy is something or other--
-The Revisions!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:14.370
Why the heck are you so happy?
Do you think you're a hero or something?

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.500
The city is in chaos and you're--

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.670
Cut it out!

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.010
For now, let's just be thankful
everyone here is safe.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:27.430
Yes, the String Puppet activated.
Then it battled a single Civilian.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.260
I've acquired the info.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.850
Yes, the results of the battle
were as predicted.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.770
Just believe me.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:37.810
Milo saved us then for this day.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.650
And this message brought us
all together again.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:43.780
But I'm not a chosen one or anything.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:48.030
You know, in fiction, the characters don't
usually realize they're the chosen ones.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:50.450
You think you're a hero
who traveled to another dimension?

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:53.200
-You really are taking this lightly.
-I agree.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.830
It does seem like
that's Daisuke Dojima's nature.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:56.750
What?

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.710
Besides, this message you speak of

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.000
-wasn't from me.
-What?

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:03.420
-Then who was it from?
-Who knows?

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.210
I have yet to introduce myself.

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.180
My name is Milo.

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:08.720
Yes, we know.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:09.800
So it seems.

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:13.260
But the one who saved you
in the past wasn't me.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.020
You mean you don't remember?

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.730
That's not it.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.310
I'm saying this is the first time
I've met all of you.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:23.860
-The first time?
-Is there another person named Milo?

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.490
Then who are you?

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.740
I don't know what you mean.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.320
What do you mean you don't know?

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.740
What about my destiny?

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.200
What about all the work I've put in?

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.290
I did my best just now.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.160
You're the one who told us
we'd be in danger someday!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.630
And that I would be the one
to protect everyone!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.800
It was you, Milo, who decided my future!

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:46.340
Hey! Where are you guys going?

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:49.220
We're going home.
We've had enough of this.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.180
Maybe you should stay at school
just for today!

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:52.300
You've got to be kidding.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:54.350
<i>Half of the building is gone.</i>

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.600
<i>It's too dangerous to be</i>
<i>at a place like this.</i>

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.020
Wait! It's safer to stay in a group!

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:00.940
Just let us go home.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.980
Ms. Yumiko!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.190
You're a teacher.
Where the heck have you been?

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:08.610
We're leaving, all right?

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.820
-I don't know what--
-What?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.660
-What are we supposed to do then?
-What should we do, Daisuke?

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:17.370
Leave him out of it!
Don't ask that terrorist for his opinion.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.660
Are you talking about me?

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.080
Are you saying you're not?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.000
<i>We saw how you were firing away at it.</i>

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:29.220
Why, you...<i></i>Don't you have any idea
how desperate I was to protect you?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.180
I'll show you my strength!

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:38.720
Halt!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.310
I won't allow the use of any more weapons.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:47.440
You guys.<i></i>If you want to die, leave.
If not, then stay at the school.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:52.450
Also, we can't let you go around
using this thing whenever you please.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.490
You're all under arrest for now.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.160
You too, miss.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.830
What? I'm being arrested?

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.370
For property damage
and violation of the firearms law,

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.420
-as well as the traffic laws...
-I see.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:06.040
They are this era's
law enforcement agency.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.630
You mean the police? Yes, I guess so.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:09.550
Good.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:13.380
You've saved me the trouble
of finding you. Let's go.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.010
What? All right.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.100
Hey, wait!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.600
Wait!

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.770
Hey, Milo!

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.780
I wonder if Daisuke is okay.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.500
He used that String Puppet
in self-defense, right?

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.580
They may say it's excessive defense.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.040
-Doesn't this remind you of the past?
-What?

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.130
You know, back in elementary school?

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:48.920
When Daisuke was kidnapped?

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.210
Then Milo must be outside the door.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:56.640
I will be explaining the situation
to the governing body here.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:59.810
-I want you all to be there.
-Fine, but what about Daisuke?

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:02.140
He threw a tantrum and is sulking now.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.270
It figures.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:06.730
In any case, you need to calm down.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:10.110
Do you want to eat?
Or do you want to get some rest--

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:12.440
Give me back my String Puppet!
I've had enough!

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:14.570
I'm the fighter
who's going to protect you all!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.240
I'm a champion! A hero!

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:19.200
But you took the String Puppet
away from me!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.750
As I said, we're holding it
as an unauthorized modified vehicle--

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:26.120
It's not like some hoodlum's car!
It's my power!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:29.000
-I've been waiting for it for a long time!
-Hey, it's almost time.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:29.920
Right.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.380
-You're so damn--
-Hey.

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.880
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.800
-Are you insane?
-You've got to be kidding!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.220
-You must have gone crazy.
-Enough already!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.020
I will say it again.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:48.940
This is Japan in 2388.

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:52.150
I am Milo, an agent
of an organization called AHRV.

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:54.690
To you, I'm a person of the future.

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:58.410
And that giant organism-like machine
in those images

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.870
is from an organization
called the Revisions.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.910
It is also handled
by people of the future.

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.410
-People of the future?
-That's ridiculous.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.290
The Revisions are our enemies.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.130
They are also your enemies.

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.920
You can't start fighting
just because you say they're the enemy.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.630
-This is like sci-fi, right?
-No, sci-fi is--

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.470
Who cares?
Why the heck is she allowed to have a gun?

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:24.180
-I've allowed it as a self-defense tool.
-Don't be ridiculous! That's a weapon.

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:30.770
Mayor Muta here. I'm the head
of the Disaster Control Headquarters.

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:34.900
In light of the fact that we must protect
ourselves from a hostile organization,

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.570
we need to get information from Ms. Milo.

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.570
Please understand this was
a high-level government decision.

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.280
We residents can't accept
that explanation.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:46.000
Of course, we will conduct
our own investigations

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:50.040
on whether this is truly the future,
and will report our findings

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.460
-and further analyze...
-What?

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.880
You've been working with her all along!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:56.960
-Isn't he just putting off a decision?
-Right.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.920
Why are we even here?

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.010
I don't know.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.010
Hold on a bit longer. I'll explain.

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:05.810
Can you prove that Milo woman is sane
and that she isn't lying?

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:07.640
No, I cannot.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:10.100
But we've already had a number
of deaths today.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:13.150
Also, the national government should be
helping us, but we cannot reach--

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.900
-We demand...
-An explanation!

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.490
Listen to that.
That's the voice of the citizens.

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.530
They've been making a commotion
this whole time.

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:23.490
I'll admit, there's a limit
to what we can do at this point.

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:27.040
Even though we have legal authority,
the situation doesn't allow us to govern.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:30.000
Which is why it's time to take measures.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.380
Since this is a crisis,
I would appreciate your support.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.300
Everyone,
the Disaster Control Headquarters

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:42.680
now declare the establishment
of Provisional Shibuya Government.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.470
A government?

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:47.100
If you will, Ms. Milo.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.350
Understood.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:53.560
AHRV is currently executing a plan to
return Shibuya back to its original era.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:57.730
I was sent here to protect
you and this city

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.110
until that time.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.530
-So Milo will fight too?
-Seems like it.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:04.780
I'd now like to assess
your ability to fight.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.700
Hey!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.200
Daisuke?

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.580
This is Daisuke Dojima.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.910
-He used a String Puppet to protect you.
-What a moron.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:15.670
We have two more.
I'd like to retrieve them if possible.

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:19.050
Well, I don't understand
the reason for this,

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:23.010
but it seems these String Puppets
can only be piloted by these students.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.470
Does that mean...

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.720
We have to fight?

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:31.890
With Daisuke Dojima as the leader,
since he has the first-hand experience,

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:34.850
we will establish
the Shibuya Defense Service or SDS.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.310
They will be operating under the police

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.280
-with Officer Izumi as liaison.
-Are you serious?

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:41.360
You're going to make students fight?

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:44.030
-That's just crazy!
-The SDF should be here!

00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:45.320
Now, shall we begin

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:47.440
the salvation of humanity?

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:52.070
Subtitle translation by Emily Noguchi
